## Model card

- **Name:** Agnes 2.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Flash-tier MoE language model associated with Sapiens AI/Agnes AI, positioned for high-throughput inference with tool calling and adaptive thinking. A related open-weight base checkpoint (`Agnes-AI/Agnes-2.5-Flash-Base`) is publicly available on Hugging Face.
- **Provider / access:** Listed in this repo as `opencode/agnes-2.5-flash` (per `model/agnes-2.5-flash/meta.json`). Public open-weight base checkpoint available as `Agnes-AI/Agnes-2.5-Flash-Base` on Hugging Face.
- **Release / knowledge:** Hugging Face base checkpoint page updated Aug 29 (year not explicitly stated on page fetch; release/cutoff not independently verified from primary vendor announcement).
- **IDs:** `opencode/agnes-2.5-flash` (served/product ID per meta); `Agnes-AI/Agnes-2.5-Flash-Base` (HF base checkpoint).
- **Context window:** 512K total reported in repo meta for `opencode/agnes-2.5-flash`; HF base model card states 1,048,576-token context (YaRN scaling over 64K base window). Relationship between served Flash product and base checkpoint not fully verified.
- **Modalities:** Repo meta states text and image input, text output. HF base model card describes a text-generation decoder-only Transformer base model (no multimodal capability explicitly documented on fetched page).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** Repo meta reports $0.05 in / $0.15 out per 1M tokens with a $0 trial tier for `opencode/agnes-2.5-flash` (not independently verified against a live vendor pricing page in this run).
- **Architecture:** HF base checkpoint (`Agnes-AI/Agnes-2.5-Flash-Base`): 202B total parameters, ~16B active per token, sparse MoE (48 layers, 160 routed experts with 6 active per token plus 1 shared expert), MLA with KV compression, hyper-connections, parallel dense FFN branch (layers 3–47), FP8 (e4m3) weights, Apache 2.0 license. Served Flash product architecture not independently verified.

